    "Description": "WebKitGTK+ is port of the WebKit portable web rendering engine to the GTK+ platform. These packages provide WebKitGTK+ for GTK+ 3.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2025-43343)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
